pex growing by more than 10% compared to the previous year.","quote":"The guidance what was given as Rs. 37,000 crore, we are pleased to inform that compared to last year, we have the capex is more than 10% what we have achieved in this quarter in Q1 itself.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/POWERGRID1_14082026184956_BSENSEReg30dt14082026Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"New requirements from data centers and green hydrogen, in addition to power generation, are driving demand for the transmission system.","quote":"here it would be the data centers, the green hydrogen, these are new set of requirements where it is going to push the transmission system, not limited to merely a generator","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/POWERGRID1_14082026184956_BSENSEReg30dt14082026Transcript.pdf","page":9.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"Equipment prices have stabilized, and management expects positive progress regarding pricing in the coming months.","quote":"We see that the prices are quite stabilized over here, and in the year in the days or the months to come, we should see much better progress as far as the price go.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/POWERGRID1_14082026184956_BSENSEReg30dt14082026Transcript.pdf","page":13.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Raw material requirements for transformers will continue to influence the overall cost of the equipment.","quote":"But having said that, the raw material, which is required for the transformers and all, that is the factor which will continue to impress upon the costing of this equipment over here.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/POWERGRID1_14082026184956_BSENSEReg30dt14082026Transcript.pdf","page":13.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"The company is focused on maintaining a balance of growth and profitability across its business activities.","quote":"Obviously, we need to tread a path of both growth and profitability, and POWERGRID is continuing to make sure that there is both growth and profitability in its endeavours whatever we are doing.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/POWERGRID1_14082026184956_BSENSEReg30dt14082026Transcript.pdf","page":16.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capex","statement":"The company's capital expenditure in the first quarter grew by over 10% compared to the previous year, aligned with its Rs. 37,000 crore annual guidance.","quote":"The guidance what was given as Rs. 37,000 crore, we are pleased to inform that compared to last year, we have the capex is more than 10% what we have achieved in this quarter in Q1 itself.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/POWERGRID1_14082026184956_BSENSEReg30dt14082026Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"The company commissioned approximately 1,635 circuit kilometers of transmission lines during the first quarter of FY27.","quote":"The major elements which have been commissioned in the quarter FY27 are about 1,635 circuit kilometers and which is almost 35% of the last year's achievement in the first quarter of Q1","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/POWERGRID1_14082026184956_BSENSEReg30dt14082026Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"orders","statement":"The company successfully won six inter-state and intra-state transmission projects under the TBCB route, representing a gross annual tariff of around Rs. 2,200 crore.","quote":"TBCB front, the competition if you are talking about, the success till July 2026 in inter-state as well as intra-state, 6 transmission projects altogether have been successfully won, with a total gross annual tariff about Rs. 2,200 crores.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/POWERGRID1_14082026184956_BSENSEReg30dt14082026Transcript.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"The company experienced an increase in debt alongside rising capital work in progress, which management views as a sign of its growth trajectory.","quote":"The capital work in progress from Rs. 41,610 crore to Rs. 50,419 crore. And the increase in debt, an obvious indication of the growth path of the company.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/POWERGRID1_14082026184956_BSENSEReg30dt14082026Transcript.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"The company secured the country's first Synchronous Condenser project, marking its entry into a new asset class.","quote":"And a new element added to the asset class in the country, and POWERGRID was the first in securing this project, that is the Synchronous Condenser, the first of its kind in the country itself.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/POWERGRID1_14082026184956_BSENSEReg30dt14082026Transcript.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"The Government of India has revised and extended the execution timelines for transmission projects to 26 to 30 months or more.","quote":"So now, Government of India has revisited these timelines and improved upon, which now stands about 26 to 30 months plus.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/POWERGRID1_14082026184956_BSENSEReg30dt14082026Transcript.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"risks","statement":"Right-of-way challenges persist due to growing urbanization and other infrastructure developments, requiring the company to adapt.","quote":"Having said that, the challenge of ROW is there, cannot be wished away. With more increased urbanization, increased other infrastructures coming into the picture, so we will have to coexist","doc_k